 "description": "Estimate domestic or international shipping cost, chargeable weight, transit time and common shipping surcharges using shipment dimensions, weight, origin, destination and service level. Estimates are not guaranteed carrier quotes; duties and taxes are excluded. Use when an agent needs to estimate delivery cost for a physical shipment before purchasing, selling, importing, exporting or selecting a shipping option.",
